<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MICHAELS STORES BEGUN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MICHAELS STORES BEGUN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Wednesday it started coverage of Michaels Stores Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1/8 to 23-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
